      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2636130452156067
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": ", therefore, he Raju Saket vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 10 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/116168611/\n1 may be also given benefit of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
